;; Ten seeds of the forest property, 50,000 worlds each. A shard stops at its first
;; failure and shrinks that one case, so more shards are what find a different failure,
;; and more worlds only reach a failure that shows up later. A shard killed at 355
;; minutes writes nothing. 50,000 worlds is about four hours at the rate the last
;; finished shard measured, inside that limit. The salt keeps this search off the
;; soak's seeds. Pushed, it runs with the salt in this file.
{:plans/label "find"
 :plans/salt "2026-10-12"
 :plans/jobs 10
 :plans/max-parallel 10
 :plans/experiments [{:exp/name "forests"
                      :exp/kind :sim
                      :exp/property "forests"
                      :exp/shards 10
                      :exp/worlds 500000
                      :exp/est-s 17000}]}
